# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets and credentials: never commit these
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment files (PROXY_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, tokens). Only the template is tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# npm config can hold registry auth tokens (company feeds, publish tokens)
.npmrc
.yarnrc*
# Keys, certificates, signing identities, provisioning profiles
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.der
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
# Apple notarization / signing credentials kept as files
notarize*.json
apple-*.json
# Tonarin's own runtime data (lives in ~/Library/Application Support/Tonarin, never in the repo)
secrets.json
settings.json
automations.json
reminders.json
usage.json
# Anything explicitly marked as private or local
*.secret
*.secrets
*.private.*
*.local.*
.secrets/
private/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local notes and personal environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working notes for AI coding sessions (machine details, internal notes). Keep local.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
# Codex / ChatGPT pets are third-party artwork: read from ~/.codex/pets, never copied here
.codex/
pets/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dependencies, builds, releases
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
release/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
# Dev launchers built by `npm run launcher` (and the pre-rename one)
*.app/
# Whisper models (hundreds of MB) and other downloaded models
models/
*.bin
*.gguf
*.onnx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs, recordings, temp, sandboxes
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
# Audio or transcripts captured while debugging must never be committed
*.wav
*.pcm
*.m4a
transcripts/
sandbox/
tmp/
*.tmp
.backup-*/
.expected.md5

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS and editors
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp

# Download site build output (npm run site)
_site/
